<Positioned left="848" top="968"><Text fontSize="17" color="#1E293BFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">400×240 · 同一段 DSL 的实际结果，</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="848" top="994"><Text fontSize="17" color="#1E293BFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">内容位置与颜色与实图一致。</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="848" top="1030"><Text fontSize="17" color="#1E293BFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">插图由同一套 Container / Stack /</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="848" top="1056"><Text fontSize="17" color="#1E293BFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">Text 构件直接画出，未嵌入图片。</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="48" top="1202"><Container width="1104" height="334" color="#FFFFFFFF" borderRadius="14" border="1 SOLID #E2E8F0FF"/></Positioned>
<Positioned left="48" top="1220"><Container width="5" height="26" color="#D92D20FF" borderRadiusTopLeft="3" borderRadiusBottomLeft="3"/></Positioned>
<Positioned left="68" top="1218"><Text fontSize="24" color="#0F172AFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">4 · 错误分类与处理</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="66" top="1256" width="280"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#0F172AFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">400 PARSE_ERROR</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="362" top="1256"><Text fontSize="20" color="#1E293BFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">语法/属性错误，消息带行列与偏移，改 DSL 后重发。</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="66" top="1281" width="280"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#0F172AFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">413 REQUEST_TOO_LARGE</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="362" top="1281"><Text fontSize="20" color="#1E293BFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">请求体越限：减少嵌套或拆成多次调用。</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="66" top="1306" width="280"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#0F172AFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">429 / 503</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="362" top="1306"><Text fontSize="20" color="#1E293BFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">限流或暂时故障：参考 Retry-After 后重试。</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="66" top="1331" width="280"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#0F172AFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">401</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="362" top="1331"><Text fontSize="20" color="#1E293BFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">需要凭据：放在请求头，不写进 DSL 或提示词。</Text></Positioned>
</Stack>
</Container>
</Snapshot>
